MID_LGV_XXX_Ism_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Ism_Closed_m01_001: （好像没必要去那里。）
MID_LGV_XXX_Kai_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Kai_Closed_m01_001: 好像没必要去那里吧。
MID_LGV_XXX_Dit_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Dit_Closed_m01_001: ……不是那边。\n要做的事……就在这里。
MID_LGV_XXX_Seo_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Seo_Closed_m01_001: 好像没必要去那里啊。
MID_LGV_XXX_Led_Closed_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_XXX_Led_Closed_m01_001: 我现在要去的地方……\n应该不是那里。
